"Known-bit error search explored error positions in observed bits and solved for unknown bits satisfying QR error-correction constraints.","画像の判定余裕が小さいコード語を一時消失として通常RSで再試行しました。","Conventional RS was retried with weak image-read codewords temporarily erased.","通常RSで、データが誤り訂正の条件を満たすことを確認しました。","Conventional RS verified that the data satisfies the error-correction conditions.","通常RSによる確認・補完・訂正を使いました。","Conventional RS was used to check, fill or correct values.","不明なセルの白黒を、QRの誤り訂正の条件に合うように求めました（部分bit制約）。","Partial-bit constraints found values for unknown cells that satisfy the QR error-correction conditions.",
