"\n配置：コピー","Region: format information\nRole: ",", bit "," of "," from the left","\nLocation: copy ","group","before","関連セル：","（2か所）","Related cells: "," (two copies)","\n各行は修復前 → 修復後。[ ]は選択ビットと他方のコピーの対応ビットです。","\nEach line shows before → after. [ ] marks the selected bit and its counterpart in the other copy.","\n白黒のビット値から形式情報の固定マスク（0x5412）を解除して解釈します。データ領域の「マスク解除」とは別です。","\nCell bits are interpreted after removing the fixed format mask (0x5412). This is separate from Unmask for the data region.","（選択中）"," (selected)",
"\n\nコピー","\n\nCopy ","\nセルの白黒（黒=1、白=0）：","\nCell bits (black=1, white=0): ","\n形式情報の固定マスク解除後：","\nAfter removing the fixed format mask: ","\nこの10ビットはECCレベル2ビットとマスク番号3ビットから生成するBCH訂正用ビットです。RSコード語ではありません。","\nThese 10 BCH correction bits are generated from the 2 ECC-level bits and 3 mask-number bits. They are not an RS codeword.","Parity has no standalone format meaning","未確定","FORMAT_SELECTION","FORMAT_LIMIT","STRUCTURAL_FIXED_CELLS","ZERO_MISMATCH","次の推奨セル: (","Next recommended cell: (","\n残る選択: ","bit → ",
